Source: pg-lion
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/cgkanchi/pg_lion

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-lion
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-lion
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: postgresql-PGVERSION-pgvector (>= 0.7)
Description: Roaring bitmap inverted indexes for PostgreSQL
 pg_lion provides inverted indexes for filtering, counting, grouping,
 arrays, JSONB and full-text search. The package includes pg_lion_citext
 and pg_lion_vector, optional companions for citext and pgvector.
 Preloading pg_lion is optional and enables its custom WAL format.
